{"id":"budto","lemma":"будто","pos":"conj","rank":211,"glosses":["as if, as though","allegedly, apparently, that (with some uncertainty)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/4f/Ru-%D0%B1%D1%83%D0%B4%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%B1%D1%83%D0%B4%D1%82%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он говорит так, будто знает всё.","en":"He talks as if he knows everything.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"so"},null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"everything, all"}]},{"text":"Помню, будто это было вчера.","en":"I remember it like it was yesterday.","words":[{"g":"to remember","l":"помнить"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"yesterday"}]},{"text":"Она говорила так, будто она моя мама.","en":"She talked as if she were my mother.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"so"},null,{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"mama"}]},{"text":"Том будто сам не свой.","en":"Tom looks freaked out.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/743863","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[2,5,"not oneself"]]},{"text":"Вы так говорите, как будто всё знаете.","en":"You talk as if you knew everything.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"how / like"},null,{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]}]}